    "detailed_description": "Witch the Showdown is a new type of game that combines high-speed parrying action with deck-building roguelike elements in an intense boss rush format. It involves building Mana through parrying, attacking with cards, and building a deck in tabletop style. In a world of science and fantasy, lead your favorite witch to victory in a tournament of battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Battle</h2>Battles are action-based and offer intense challenges, requiring you to parry to build up Mana before using cards to attack. Every battle is an intense boss battle, so build up your deck with a variety of unique accessories and cards before taking them on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.poster.avif?t=1726582970\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.webm?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.mp4?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Deck Building</h2>Build a deck in tabletop style. Join in on events to strengthen your character, and get cards and accessories at the shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/20976bed6c2aaea00fae0c5f184a8ad9.poster.avif?t=1726582970\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/20976bed6c2aaea00fae0c5f184a8ad9.webm?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/20976bed6c2aaea00fae0c5f184a8ad9.mp4?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/97f657e83c6ec80c7dfda6610ea870a4.poster.avif?t=1726582970\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/97f657e83c6ec80c7dfda6610ea870a4.webm?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/97f657e83c6ec80c7dfda6610ea870a4.mp4?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Witch the Showdown is a new type of game that combines high-speed parrying action with deck-building roguelike elements in an intense boss rush format. It involves building Mana through parrying, attacking with cards, and building a deck in tabletop style. In a world of science and fantasy, lead your favorite witch to victory in a tournament of battles!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Battle</h2>Battles are action-based and offer intense challenges, requiring you to parry to build up Mana before using cards to attack. Every battle is an intense boss battle, so build up your deck with a variety of unique accessories and cards before taking them on.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.poster.avif?t=1726582970\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.webm?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/9f9d06ea56a20c0eca1926029c179af2.mp4?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >-Deck Building</h2>Build a deck in tabletop style. Join in on events to strengthen your character, and get cards and accessories at the shop.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/20976bed6c2aaea00fae0c5f184a8ad9.poster.avif?t=1726582970\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/20976bed6c2aaea00fae0c5f184a8ad9.webm?t=1726582970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103620/extras/2